'''Oncoming Maelstrom (Expert)''' is the 4th [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. It was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]] and appears every Saturday. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Clockwork Cat]].

